Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.90,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2.2\c&H161617&\3c&H161617&\fad(984,0)\fsp-2\1a&HFF&\blur0.5\t(939,984,\1a&H00&)}I Will Surpass You{26:13}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.90,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(984,0)\fsp-2}I Will Surpass You{26:13}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.91,0:01:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baroque Works?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.13,0:01:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know that I've even heard of\Nsuch a company Are you sure it exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.91,0:02:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just ordinary citizens\Nof Alabasta, Mr. Marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.93,0:02:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't want to hurt good citizens\Njust because there's a rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Sergeant Major, they...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.95,0:02:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why were you hesitating, Marine?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wait for proof, you\Nwon't prevent anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.21,0:02:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be able to tell\Nwho the enemy is immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're very sorry, Sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.61,0:02:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only have until 4.30.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.85,0:02:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.47,0:02:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.13,0:02:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robot, Robot, Robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.53,0:02:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this is a very important\Nmission the boss has assigned to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're absolutely correct\Nabout that, Miss Father's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do you know what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet we'll get big promotions for\Npulling this off successfully, Robot, Robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.65,0:02:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do hope that that is a planned reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, this is quite a difficult\Nmission when you think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Father's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.18,0:02:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're shooting a cannonball into\Nthe crowd using such a big cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the reward should be just as big!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robot, it's almost time\Nto go now, Mr. Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.41,0:03:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're ready to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.41,0:03:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.23,0:03:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it that you think I\Ndo not understand, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.21,0:03:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kong! Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.51,0:03:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.37,0:03:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to die here very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.89,0:04:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poison from my hook\Nhas entered your wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your body is probably\Nbecoming numb right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter whether\Nyou win or lose this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.01,0:04:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your body will still be buried underneath\Nthe rubble when this temple collapses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.27,0:04:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fifteen seconds until we shoot! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cannon aimed at the center of\NPalace Square, rivet rivet! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, what the hell is\Nit you're trying to do anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.73,0:04:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really don't have time to play around!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.15,0:04:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we mess this up, we're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.43,0:04:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.34,0:04:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Usat, but I already know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now just shut up and stand there quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm calculating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, shut up if I had\Nany idea what was going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.87,0:04:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you just explain what the\Nhell it is you're planning already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll know soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.31,0:04:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robot, Robot, Robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.63,0:04:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen, Mr. Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a very special occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.05,0:04:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should do a countdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.35,0:04:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good plan, Miss Father's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good plan, a very good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forecasting a typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.73,0:05:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.23,0:05:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Countdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cyclone Tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? But wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.07,0:05:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cyclone Tempo is just\Na silly boomerang game
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.75,0:05:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just head for the clock tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.99,0:05:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.09,0:05:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're flying up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.57,0:05:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jump up to where Sanji is, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.43,0:05:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is her big plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.83,0:05:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make it all the way up\Nthere piggyback like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, you know what to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.81,0:05:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I get the idea, but it's risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I just have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.15,0:05:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late to turn back at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.43,0:05:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tony, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Phoebe, now just hang on tightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.15,0:06:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.15,0:06:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, get on my right leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,11 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.87,0:06:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.55,0:06:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I just throw him to the\Ntop of that tower. Turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.99,0:06:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.05,0:06:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.73,0:06:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a flat of the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.21,0:06:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your footing. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.31,0:06:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.41,0:06:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a couple of weirdos up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.95,0:06:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Miss Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rivet, rivet, rivet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.91,0:06:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd recognize that little\Ntraitor to our company anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.05,0:06:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They noticed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.37,0:06:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're still in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.47,0:06:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they shoot at us, we're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.71,0:07:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is you really\Nwant can't be in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.45,0:07:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're fighting for\Nsomebody else's goal now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.99,0:07:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how can there be any\Npoint in time for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.61,0:07:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only you would just get\Nrid of a friend or two,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.09,0:07:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could easily avoid so many\Nof these inconvenient problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loyalty is only for idiots and weaklings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, you really don't\Nunderstand anything, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.55,0:07:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi is always telling people\Nnot to risk their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.93,0:07:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the first to lay down her\Nlife in order to save others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.65,0:07:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't help her,\Nshe'll die. You'll kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.95,0:07:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what makes her such a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why not ditch the\Nprincess and save yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because none of us want Vivi to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Helping each other is what friends do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's why none of us will leave\Nher behind or quit fighting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as she doesn't give up\Non her country, neither will we!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:08:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if that means all the\Nrest of you end up dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we die, we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.91,0:08:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adjust Ribbit's Ribbit's Gun for attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an unexpected catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.91,0:08:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adjusting Yellow Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.21,0:08:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How nice, how nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are the perfect prey for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you bastards are doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.89,0:08:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pointing your guns at Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.97,0:08:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.88,0:08:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of them are a sniper team.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.45,0:08:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper! I'll throw you guys up anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll change the direction, but\Nyou need to figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.43,0:08:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.83,0:08:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have seven seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.43,0:08:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just figure something out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, Phoebe, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.77,0:08:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sending you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aim and fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our bullets are set to\Ncrash into each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.91,0:08:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then they're going to explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.25,0:08:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.57,0:09:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.13,0:09:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.31,0:09:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just throw me with all\Nyour strength, Tony!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.42,0:09:10.97,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,725)\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx80\fscy80\c&HF8F4FC&\blur0.8}{5 Seconds Until Attack-OG}5 Seconds Until Detonation{Poppy}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use... Robot, Robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.73,0:09:22.35,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,725)\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx80\fscy80\c&HF8F4FC&\blur0.8}{4 Seconds Until Attack-OG}4 Seconds Until Detonation{Poppy}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.79,0:09:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd Miss Wednesday go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peacock! String!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.37,0:09:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up there!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.74,0:09:39.41,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,725)\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx80\fscy80\c&HF8F4FC&\blur0.8}{3 Seconds Until Attack-OG}3 Seconds Until Detonation{Poppy}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.57,0:09:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can talk as tough as you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.47,0:09:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And keep blathering on about\Nfriendship if you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but your body is still freezing up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:09:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look pathetic, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.39,0:10:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.22,0:10:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.55,0:10:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.53,0:10:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.77,0:10:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you missed us!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.36,0:10:17.45,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,725)\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx80\fscy80\c&HF8F4FC&\blur0.8}{2 Seconds Until Attack-OG}2 Seconds Until Detonation{Poppy}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rush back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.67,0:10:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.13,0:10:33.55,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,725)\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx80\fscy80\c&HF8F4FC&\blur0.8}{1 Second Until Attack-OG}1 Second Until Detonation{Poppy}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.43,0:10:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.33,0:10:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of here, you brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you sneak in through\Nthe shortcut again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.35,0:10:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatekeeper! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:11:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would the two of you please say\Nsomething to the kids to keep them away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.25,0:11:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.79,0:11:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.49,0:11:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The secret phase. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.69,0:11:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, where did Princess Vivi go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.01,0:11:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't tell you. It's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.65,0:11:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clock tower, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It stopped, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.17,0:12:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.51,0:12:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened with the cannon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.53,0:12:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently something's\Ngone wrong up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still haven't seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.97,0:12:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cannonball has a timing device.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something, it'll explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.57,0:12:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:13:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A time bomb? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.75,0:13:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was very well prepared, Cobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.07,0:13:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to be willing to\Nadmit that much, surely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.07,0:13:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most successful missions always\Naccount for unforeseen circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this case, for instance, even if\Nsomething happens to the cannoneers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.91,0:13:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cannonball will\Nstill explode on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The attack will only be\Ndelayed by a few seconds or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I did originally want it to\Nbe shot into the center of the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the cannonball is\Nbig enough that it should
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.35,0:13:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do plenty of damage\Nfrom right where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stopping the rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saving the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.61,0:13:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those worthless ideas\Nyou've clung to for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.65,0:13:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, they just\Ncreated more victims for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.57,0:14:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.95,0:14:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're never going to save this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit! This isn't right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stopping the cannoneers should\Nhave stopped the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A timer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.47,0:14:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Considering its power, even\Nif it explodes from up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.31,0:14:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will still kill all the people\Nin the square and the town?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what's going to happen now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.37,0:14:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.28,0:14:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does this mean it was impossible all along
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.99,0:14:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for us to stop the\Nexplosion from happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.85,0:14:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made us spend all\Nthis time looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.77,0:14:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even announced the attack\Nso we would do just that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how far will Crocodile insist\Non going to make fools of us all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not enough for him to\Ntear this country apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.45,0:14:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has to mock us while he's doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's why none of us will leave\Nher behind or quit fighting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.57,0:15:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as she doesn't give up\Non her country, neither will we!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.63,0:15:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defeat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.85,0:15:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've finally managed to speak,\Nand that's all you can come up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.43,0:16:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's an acceptable bluff\Nfrom a loser who's about to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course, like any\Nbluff, it's empty air.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.33,0:16:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except I'm the man who'll\Nbe king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you damn brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really knew\Nanything about this scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.25,0:16:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't make such\Nan idiotic statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.07,0:16:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you before, there are\Nthousands of rookies just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.87,0:16:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every one of them chasing\Ntheir naive little dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sooner you understand the\Ntrue level of the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sooner you'll give up\Non your foolish dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.79,0:17:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's gonna beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.41,0:17:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, was that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think it's the Birdman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.07,0:17:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pell!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.55,0:17:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this place brings\Nback so many memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.61,0:17:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sansan clan's super secret base.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.27,0:17:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pel, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.49,0:17:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You certainly were a mischievous\Nlittle child, Princess Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.99,0:17:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave us no end of trouble with\Nall your pranks and disappearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.01,0:17:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.03,0:17:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's she doing in the ammunition bunker?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.15,0:17:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi, how many times have we told\Nyou not to go near the ammunition bunker?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.85,0:17:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.19,0:17:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was trying to make some\Nfireworks, but I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.51,0:17:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's the anniversary of the\Nday you joined the army, pal, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.01,0:17:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've told you a hundred times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never ever come near here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.53,0:18:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.73,0:18:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you touch the princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're through!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.75,0:18:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one dares hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Igaram!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could have been much worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.03,0:18:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if you were killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.25,0:18:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.16,0:18:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go higher! Higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, I need you to promise me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never tell the king about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.63,0:18:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made it clear that I'm\Nnot supposed to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.11,0:18:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told me never to go\Nflying with you on my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.87,0:18:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're scared, fine, but I'll\Nnever forgive you if you stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.49,0:18:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, didn't you say you'd\Ndo anything I wanted you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.71,0:19:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pell? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You train for battle every day Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.57,0:19:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm a guard It's my\Nduty to protect this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.59,0:19:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So who will you be fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.73,0:19:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.09,0:19:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.51,0:19:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I protect. They're different?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.37,0:19:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They serve different purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.85,0:19:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.76,0:19:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.99,0:19:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud that I've been able to\Nserve you all these years, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.63,0:19:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protecting the Nefertari\Nfamily has been an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.31,0:20:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Alabasta's guardian deity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.21,0:20:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Falcon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.21,0:20:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I am sworn to destroy the\Nenemies of the Royal Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.73,0:20:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.01,0:21:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.71,0:21:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.13,0:21:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...saved us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.45,0:22:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.29,0:22:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.25,0:22:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you, are you out of your mind? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.87,0:22:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.95,0:22:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tashigi, I need you to keep a vigilant\Neye on this country and where it ends up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.51,0:22:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether it falls or whether it survives,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.65,0:22:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dawn of a brand new and\Nhistoric age is on the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.03,0:22:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.05,0:22:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they stopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.43,0:23:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting! Stop fighting! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.43,0:23:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.43,0:23:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.43,0:23:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.19,0:23:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.51,0:23:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.03,0:23:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.13,0:23:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.11,0:23:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.49,0:23:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.15,0:23:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.27,0:23:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.15,0:23:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.69,0:23:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.63,0:23:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.49,0:23:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.21,0:23:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.53,0:23:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.15,0:23:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.65,0:23:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.53,0:23:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.97,0:23:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.85,0:23:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You doped!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.39,0:23:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you just standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.05,0:24:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your rears in gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.43,0:24:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how,\Njust stop the rebellion!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.07,0:24:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to keep the casualties\Nas low as we possibly can!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.41,0:24:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.19,0:24:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.35,0:24:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.67,0:24:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.65,0:25:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The scorpion's venom\Nshould be working by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.81,0:25:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where does this brat\Nget his strength from?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.91,0:25:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.97,0:25:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five's team was taken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.85,0:25:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.25,0:25:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.33,0:25:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.85,0:25:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.13,0:25:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying that they're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.05,0:25:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've just received word.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.63,0:25:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pirates have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.39,0:26:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a two-bit nobody\Nwho comes from who knows where!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.41,0:26:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.39,0:26:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.51,0:26:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care who you are\Nbecause it doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.37,0:26:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are, I will beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.27,0:26:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now fall with this ancient temple\Nand let the Desert Sands bury you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.17,0:26:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabers!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.43,0:26:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pascados!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.97,0:26:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.71,0:27:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.13,0:27:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.15,0:27:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desert!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.89,0:27:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.45,0:27:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.07,0:27:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.37,0:28:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.57,0:28:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He punched him straight up through\Nthe bedrock beneath the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.59,0:28:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.37,0:28:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.77,0:28:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.59,0:29:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that this conflict has escalated,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.67,0:29:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more blood will be shed\Nthroughout the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.73,0:29:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.87,0:29:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to get me home\Nsafely, but there's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.53,0:29:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to get home as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.79,0:29:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't make it back in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.53,0:29:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a million innocent citizens will\Ngive their lives needlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.87,0:29:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.78,0:29:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.70,0:29:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is beat\Nup that crocodile guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.97,0:29:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.93,0:30:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how he got\Nthere in the first place,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.23,0:30:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure it can only mean one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.45,0:30:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.77,0:30:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.01,0:30:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never doubted it for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.35,0:30:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can only mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.27,0:30:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he did it! He won!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.35,0:30:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, our enemy is defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.75,0:30:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't shed any more blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.97,0:30:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.19,0:30:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.13,0:31:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.21,0:31:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.31,0:31:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.01,0:31:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so suspicious, Kozan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.81,0:31:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rain will fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.33,0:31:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.29,0:31:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll end.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.33,0:31:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.55,0:32:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The madness has finally stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.67,0:32:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're beginning to hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.15,0:32:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rain is starting to clear the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.95,0:32:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.41,0:32:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.61,0:32:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.85,0:32:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.33,0:32:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've heard Vivi's voice. Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.73,0:32:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe, the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.33,0:33:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe, I didn't know the\Nprincess had come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.67,0:33:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Crocodile, how did he get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.63,0:33:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.09,0:33:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so they're still\Ncalling him Sir Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.47,0:33:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see if he's Sir\NCrocodile after I tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.31,0:33:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's his?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.65,0:33:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.03,0:33:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.27,0:33:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rain has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.97,0:33:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll fall again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.07,0:33:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As it used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.69,0:33:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our nightmare is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.19,0:33:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.37,0:34:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.01,0:34:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sweat.

